# Ableton working files. Audio stays in the repo - bounces, sources and the generated
# FX renders - so a clone is the whole project, not a project minus its sound.
# What is excluded is only what Live rebuilds by itself: the timestamped auto-backups
# it writes on every save, and the .asd analysis caches.
project-files/**/Backup/
*.asd
project-files/**/current-arrangement-review-*.json
